# map 48, two human sides: the mouse as the first side's directions and
# button (input_mouse, S27FE:03D4), with m48_mouse.mice beside it.  F7
# turns the mouse off and on again (the driver's reset leaves the pointer
# right of the middle: a direction once), F8 steps its speed, F7 off and
# on once more with a button held; see port/README.md
30.00 f7
32.00 f7
46.00 f8
48.00 f8
50.00 f8
54.00 f7
56.00 f7
